<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="icon" type="" image/x-icon" href="./images/n-favicon.png">
  <title>Personal NFT Mint</title>
  <meta name="author" content="Nic Nurge">
  <meta name="description" content="Personal NFT Mint is a web application that allows users to mint their own NFTs">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Michroma&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
    integrity="sha384-rbsA2VBKQhggwzxH7pPCaAqO46MgnOM80zW1RWuH61DGLwZJEdK2Kadq2F9CUG65" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/style.css">
</head>

<body id="top">
  <div class="b-example-divider"></div>



  <!-- ##### HEADER ##### -->

  <%- include('header') %>




    <!-- ##### HERO / SPLASH SCREEN ##### -->
    <div class="container-fluid px-0">
      <div class="card text-bg-dark border-0 bg-transparent rounded-0 py-5">
        <img src="./images/splash-background-img.png" class="card-img" alt="Splash">
        <div class="card-img-overlay align-items-center text-center d-flex flex-column justify-content-end pb-5">
          <h1 class="card-title display-5 fw-bold">Nordak's MACT NFT Project</h1>
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <p class="card-text lead mb-5">Create your own unique NFTs or something like that.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>



    <!-- ##### FEATURED ##### -->
    <div id="featured" class="container col-xxl-8 px-4 py-5"></div>
    <div class="b-example-divider"></div>

    <div id="featured" class="container px-4 py-5">
      <h2 class="pb-2 text-center">Featured Project</h2>

      <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 align-items-md-start g-5 py-5">

        <!-- LEFT: project image + card info -->
        <div class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-lg-6">
          <div class="card border-dark">
            <img src="./images/arc-toroid.png" class="card-img-top" alt="Arc Toroid">
            <div class="card-body text-center text-dark">
              <h5 class="card-title">Arc Toroid</h5>
              <p class="card-text text-muted">masterNordak</p>
              <!-- <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Project Profile</button> -->
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT: NFT metadata fields -->
        <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3">

          <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2">
            <h4 class="fw-normal mb-1">NFT Name:</h4>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Arc Toroid</p>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2">
            <h4 class="fw-normal mb-1">Description:</h4>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Generative 3D toroidal form — Processing sketch series</p>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2">
            <h4 class="fw-normal mb-1">Editions:</h4>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">1 / 1,000</p>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2">
            <h4 class="fw-normal mb-1">Price:</h4>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">0.5 ETH</p>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2">
            <h4 class="fw-normal mb-1">Opens:</h4>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">June 2026</p>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3"></div>


          <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2 mt-3">
            <a href="/project/1" class="btn btn-outline-light">Go to this project</a>
            <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-outline-light">See all projects</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>



    <!-- ##### ABOUT ##### -->
    <div id="about" class="container px-4 py-5">
      <h2 class="pb-2 mb-5 text-center">About the Artist</h2>
      <!-- <p class="lead">Founding Artist</p> -->
      <div class="row g-5 align-items-start">
        <div class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-lg-4">
          <div class="card border-dark">
            <img src="./images/artist-photo.png" class="card-img-top" alt="Nic Nurge">
            <div class="card-body text-center text-dark">
              <h5 class="card-title">Nic Nurge</h5>
              <p class="card-text text-muted">Digital Artist & Developer</p>
              <!-- <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Artist's Profile</button> -->
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-8">
          <p>I’m a cybersecurity leader by day, creative technology student by night, and apparently a founding artist
            now
            because the internet lets us invent titles and put them on cards. My work usually starts somewhere between
            code, systems, pixels, and “what happens if I break this in an interesting way?” I’m drawn to projects that
            mix structure with weirdness, especially when I can take something technical and turn it into something
            people
            might actually want to look at.</p>
          <p>A lot of my creative work lives in the space between digital art, Web3, generative systems, and interactive
            design. I like the idea of using technology as more than just a productivity machine slowly stealing
            everyone’s will to live. For me, creative tech is about building small worlds, visual systems, and
            experiences
            that feel personal, even when they are made with code, algorithms, or tools that sound like they were named
            by
            a committee of exhausted robots.</p>
          <div class="d-grid gap-3 d-sm-flex mt-4">
            <!-- <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-light"><a href="./contact">Contact Me</a></div> -->
            <a href="./contact" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-4">Contact Me</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>



    <!-- ##### FOOTER ##### -->

    <%- include('footer') %>




      <!-- ##### SCRIPTS / BOOTSTRAP JS ##### -->
      <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
        integrity="sha384-kenU1KFdBIe4zVF0s0G1M5b4hcpxyD9F7jL+jjXkk+Q2h455rYXK/7HAuoJl+0I4"
        crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
      <script type="module" src="./js/index.js"></script>
</body>

</html>